\section{Discussion and Limitations}
\subsection{Using the Shortlist in Architectural Work}
The immediate value of the workflow is a smaller, documented choice set.\aidraft{} An architect can compare candidate identities and benefits without manually creating 630 detailed models, while retaining the option to inspect the whole universe. The score provides one declared ordering; the Pareto set keeps lower-volume alternatives visible. The review status identifies which numbers have a second computational route and which translated forms still require assessment. This is a proposed use of the outputs, not a measured reduction in architects' working time or evidence from a user study.
